THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL USED BY DISPLAY-WEB
======================================

The main library declares @jigging/display-model and @jigging/user-updates as
exact external dependencies. The fixed browser bundle includes pure display
model helpers (Bread) and user-updates validation (MPL-2.0). Their matching
source is available at https://github.com/jiggy/jig, and the retained root
terms and MPL-2.0 text accompany this package.

BUNDLED BROWSER RENDERER
-----------------------

Preact 11.0.1 is a build-only dependency of @jigging/display-web, bundled into its fixed browser assets
exported as fixed package asset values. The installed product resolves no Preact
package and downloads no browser dependency.

https://github.com/preactjs/preact

